(\ln p_{2})=\left({\frac{Q_{\mathrm{st}}+\left(\ln p_{1}\left({\frac{R T_{1}T_{2}}{T_{2}-T_{1}}}\right)\right)}{\left({\frac{R T_{1}T_{2}}{T_{2}-T_{1}}}\right)}}\right)
